Effective Date: July 2026

Welcome to Vipto User. Your privacy is important to us.

This Privacy Policy explains what information we collect,
why we collect it, how it is used, and how we protect it.

By using the Vipto User application, you agree to the
practices described in this policy.


------------------------------------------------------------
1. ABOUT VIPTO USER
------------------------------------------------------------

Vipto User is a location-based marketplace application that
helps users discover products available in nearby local stores.

The application allows users to browse products without
creating an account.

Users only need to register when they want to check the
availability of a product at a store.

The platform is designed to connect customers with nearby
verified sellers while collecting only the minimum amount
of personal information required for the service to function.


------------------------------------------------------------
2. INFORMATION WE COLLECT
------------------------------------------------------------

For the MVP version of Vipto User, we collect only the
information required to provide core functionality.


PERSONAL INFORMATION

When you create an account, we may collect:

- Full Name
- Mobile Phone Number

This information is used to create your customer profile
and communicate your product availability requests to sellers.


DEVICE LOCATION

With your permission, the application accesses your device's
location to:

- Display nearby stores
- Show products available around you
- Calculate approximate distance to stores
- Improve search results

Location access is requested only after the application starts
and can be disabled anytime through your device settings.


USAGE INFORMATION

The application may automatically collect:

- Device model
- Android version
- Application version
- Crash reports
- Performance information
- Anonymous analytics

This information helps improve application stability and
user experience.


------------------------------------------------------------
3. INFORMATION WE DO NOT COLLECT
------------------------------------------------------------

The MVP version of Vipto User does NOT collect or store:

- Credit or debit card information
- Banking information
- UPI details
- Government identity documents
- Aadhaar number
- PAN number
- Passport information
- Passwords
- Email address (unless voluntarily provided)
- Contacts
- SMS
- Call history
- Photos from your gallery without permission
- Background location


------------------------------------------------------------
4. HOW YOUR INFORMATION IS USED
------------------------------------------------------------

Your information is used only for operating the marketplace.

Examples include:

- Creating your customer account
- Sending availability requests to sellers
- Identifying which customer made a request
- Displaying nearby products
- Opening store locations in Google Maps
- Improving application performance
- Preventing spam and misuse

We never sell your personal information.


------------------------------------------------------------
5. PRODUCT AVAILABILITY REQUESTS
------------------------------------------------------------

When you press "Check Availability", Vipto creates a request
containing:

- Your User ID
- Your phone number
- Product ID
- Shop ID
- Request status
- Request creation time

The seller receives this request and can respond by confirming
or rejecting product availability.

No payment information is shared during this process.


------------------------------------------------------------
6. LOCATION DATA
------------------------------------------------------------

Location permission is used only to:

- Find nearby shops
- Display distance from your current location
- Improve product recommendations

Your precise location is NOT continuously tracked.

The application only accesses location when needed to provide
nearby search functionality.


------------------------------------------------------------
7. DATA STORAGE
------------------------------------------------------------

Vipto stores application data using Google Firebase Firestore.

The current MVP database contains four main collections:

- Users
- Shops
- Products
- Requests


USER INFORMATION

User information stored includes:

- Name
- Phone number
- User role
- Account creation date
- Latitude
- Longitude


PRODUCT INFORMATION

Product information includes:

- Product name
- Category
- Price
- Product image
- Shop ID

Images uploaded by sellers are securely stored using
Cloudinary.


------------------------------------------------------------
